  On September 23rd, 2025, I published a video on YouTube titled 'The Man Who

  Murdered Charlie Kirk' reviewing all of the available public information
  regarding

  Tyler Robinson, his assassin, and Lance Twiggs - Tyler's roommate and romantic

  partner. Shortly thereafter, I was contacted by someone familiar with Lance
  and Tyler.

  They provided an alleged firsthand account of what their relationship was
  like, how it

  developed, and some of the events that may have driven Tyler to do what he
  did. They

  have allowed me to publish this information, but wish to remain anonymous.

  They provided me with the following.

  1. Photos verifying their connection

  2. Their firsthand account of Tyler and Lance's relationship

  3. Photos of Tyler and Lance's apartment, as well as drawings allegedly made
  by
